            'questions' => [
                'Shows loyalty and commitment to the institution by upholding the institutional vision, mission, philosophy, and values.',
                'Takes effort to be present and participate in institutional activities.',
                'Safeguards confidential information that one has access to especially if disclosures would be detrimental to the interest of the institution.',
                'Demonstrates personal responsibility, commitment and loyalty to the institution by adhering to the institutional code of conduct and prescribed ethical work.',
